# tools/toolchain.versions — the single source of truth for this repo's
# toolchain pins (task-055). Shell-sourceable KEY=value; read by
# tools/verify.sh and .claude/hooks/format-on-write.sh.
#
# Nothing here is read at build time by go.mod, go.work, or
# .github/workflows/*.yml — none of those formats can read an external file.
# Those pins are duplicated on purpose and machine-checked against this file
# by tools/verify.sh's `pins` leg (leg_pins), which compares GO_VERSION
# against go.work's `go` directive and every `go-version:` in
# .github/workflows/*.yml only. Dockerfiles are not read by leg_pins — no
# service Dockerfile takes a Go/Alpine version as an ARG, so there is
# currently nothing there to check. Bump GO_VERSION here, run
# `tools/verify.sh --only pins`, fix what it names.
#
# gofumpt/goimports versions are embedded in the golangci-lint release.
# Node tooling (eslint, vite, vitest) is pinned by frontend/package.json and
# its lockfile.
GO_VERSION=1.27.0
GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=v2.13.1
